cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this oracle, cite LBFGSpp and Eigen, which it solves with.
title: Head-fit oracle (host-native test, not vendored)
abstract: >-
  gen.cpp is written here; nothing is vendored. build.sh clones
  V-Sekai-fire/interactor-aria-lbfgspp at the pinned commit (LBFGSpp 0.3.0, MIT;
  Eigen 3.4.90, MPL-2.0) into .deps/ (gitignored), or uses the clone ARIA names
  after checking it is at that commit, and compiles gen.cpp against them
  unmodified. The only local adaptation is wrapping the LBFGSB.h include in
  `#define private public`, as tests/lbfgsb_oracle and tests/cage_oracle do.
  Neither library is linked into any guest ELF.
type: software
authors:
  - name: V-Sekai-fire
  - name: chibifire
references:
